sar peth ke yeh bano ne kaha aaja ali asghar raat huwi<br>
tadpata hai khali jhula aaja ali asghar raat huwi<br>
<br>
1.tanhayi tujhe tadpayegi aur neend tujhe na ayegi<br>
har simt hai run mein andhiyara aaja ali asghar raat huwi<br>
<br>
2. maidan ko jo noor-e-ayen gaya dil ka bhi mere sukh chain gaya<br>
baqi na raha jeene ka mazaa aaja ali asghar raat huwi<br>
<br>
3. gham ka hai asar nazaron me matam hai bapa gham kharon me<br>
hain nouha kuna dhadkan ki sada aaja ali asghar raat huwi<br>
<br>
4. qaimoun mein hamare aag lagi chadar bhi hamare sar se chini<br>
ab kaun madad ko ayega aaja ali asghar raat huwi<br>
<br>
5. kis tarha se dekhon yeh manzar hai nok-e-sina par tera sar<br>
chalta hai mere dil par bhala aaja ali asghar raat huwi<br>
<br>
6. wo teer jo tujh se bhari tha us teer se tera halq chida<br>
yeh sonch ke dil phatta hai mera aaja ali asghar raat huwi<br>
<br>
7. tujh bin hai har ek manzar suna aghosh hai suna ghar suna<br>
gehwara bhi hain suna-suna aaja ali asghar raat huwi<br>
<br>
8. gham asghar ka na bhul saki yeh haal tha bano ka razvi<br>
ta umr yeh lab par tha nauha aaja ali asghar raat huwi